    <item>
      <title>Vector: my day in one direction</title>
      <link>https://juanmanuel.petrer.eu/en/proyectos/vector/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://juanmanuel.petrer.eu/en/proyectos/vector/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;vx-row&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;vx-words&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;vx-kicker&#34;&gt;The idea&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;one-arrow-instead-of-six-rings&#34;&gt;One arrow instead of six rings&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Each day has a handful of goals: eat enough, drink, train if it&amp;rsquo;s a training day, the English question, the tasks. The number counts the ones you&amp;rsquo;ve met. The arrow counts partial progress too, so it moves even before you&amp;rsquo;ve closed any of them.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Only what makes sense today counts: on a rest day, the workout goal isn&amp;rsquo;t there.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The same calculation on the iPhone, the watch and the widget.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;vx-stage&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;vx-phone&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; data-vx-day&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;vx-phone__scr&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;vx-eyebrow&#34;&gt;Thursday 12 Nov&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;vx-hello&#34;&gt;Good afternoon&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;vx-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;vx-between&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;b&gt;Your day&lt;/b&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;vx-small&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-num vx-done&#34; data-vx-done&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; of 6 goals&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;vx-bar&#34; data-vx-daybar style=&#34;--f:0.42&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;vx-bar__track&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;vx-bar__fill&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;vx-bar__dot&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;vx-chips&#34; data-vx-chips&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;vx-chip is-on&#34;&gt;Workout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-chip is-on&#34;&gt;English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-chip&#34;&gt;Water&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-chip&#34;&gt;Creatine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-chip&#34;&gt;Meals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-chip&#34;&gt;Tasks&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;vx-duo&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;vx-card&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-small&#34;&gt;Meals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-num vx-n22&#34;&gt;1,640 &lt;span class=&#34;vx-small&#34;&gt;kcal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;vx-meter&#34;&gt;&lt;i style=&#34;width:63%;background:var(--vx-ink)&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;vx-card&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-small&#34;&gt;Water&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;vx-num vx-n22&#34;&gt;2.1 &lt;span class=&#34;vx-small&#34;&gt;/ 3 L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;vx-meter&#34;&gt;&lt;i style=&#34;width:70%;background:var(--vx-water)&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;vx-row vx-row--flip&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;vx-words&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;vx-kicker&#34;&gt;Workouts&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
